分布式存储重大项目的技术支持，包括POC售前测试评估、客户技术交流、一线技术求助响应等\n2.文档输出：负责公司分布式存储存储相关市场技术文档的输出，包括技术白皮书、产品规格表、产品技术PPT、产品彩页、友商竞争分析等\n3.产品支持：参与产品全生命周期的管理，负责市场需求的输入、研发文档的评审、解决方案的设计，作为市场技术经理参与IPD流程，支撑产品按期发布","Require":"岗位要求：\n1.了解存储领域的基础知识，具有良好的沟通和表达能力，能够支撑重大项目的技术交流和答疑工作，熟悉分布式存储或有相关工作经验的优先\n2.具备优秀的文档撰写能力，能够按要求输出高质量的产品技术文档\n3.具备产品管理或方案规划能力、熟悉公司IPD流程的优先\n4.欢迎一切志于挑战自己、追求卓越的人，相信你会快速收获成长！","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-27T17:40:13","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"4526bd49-b42b-4f36-9a16-1fd16d51ca18","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390822684,"PostDateInt":1774339309000,"PostDate":"2026-03-24T16:01:49","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"存储硬件工程师(J18473)","OrgId":700275636,"Org":"云与计算存储产品部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["四川省·成都市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责\n1.存储服务器硬件全流程开发：主导存储服务器产品的硬件开发工作，包括需求分析、系统架构设计、元器件选型、电路原理图设计（Schematic Design）及PCB布局布线（Layout）指导。依据Intel/AMD等主流X86架构或ARM架构的技术规范，完成主板及系统级硬件的设计与实现，确保设计满足性能、成本及可靠性目标。\n2.硬件调试与问题攻关：负责存储服务器样机的硬件调试、功能验证与性能测试。熟练运用示波器、逻辑分析仪、误码仪等专业设备，对高速信号（如DDR4/DDR5、PCIe Gen4/Gen5、SAS/SATA等）进行完整性测试与分析，精准定位并解决硬件设计缺陷、信号完整性（SI）、电源完整性（PI）及电磁兼容性（EMC）相关问题。\n3.技术支持与跨部门协作：为生产、测试及售后部门提供技术支持，解决产品在试产、量产及市场应用中出现的硬件技术问题。与结构、散热、固件（BIOS/BMC）、软件及系统团队紧密协作，参与整机系统联调，优化服务器整体稳定性与能效表现。\n4.技术文档编写与标准化：依据公司开发流程，编写并归档硬件设计文档、测试报告、BOM清单及生产指导文件。参与硬件设计规范与技术标准的制定，推动设计重用与平台化，提升开发效率与产品质量。","Require":"岗位要求\n1.教育背景与工作经验：电子、通信、自动化、计算机等相关专业本科及以上学历。具备3至5年服务器、存储设备或高端工控机硬件开发经验，完整参与过至少一款服务器产品的量产落地。\n2.专业技能与工具应用：精通数字与模拟电路设计原理，具备扎实的高速电路设计理论基础。熟练掌握Cadence、Altium Designer等EDA设计工具，能独立完成原理图设计与复杂多层板的Layout检查。深入理解X86或ARM服务器架构，熟悉CPU、内存、网卡、GPU等关键器件的特性与接口协议。\n3.实践能力与问题解决：具备出色的动手能力与故障分析能力，能独立完成硬件调试与验证工作。熟悉EMC/EMI设计规范与整改流程，有实际的安规认证（如CCC、UL、CE）经验者优先。具备一定的英文读写能力，能熟练阅读并理解芯片Datasheet及技术文档。\n4.综合素质：工作认真负责，具备良好的沟通协调能力、团队合作精神及抗压能力。对新技术保持敏感，具备较强的学习能力与创新意识，能够在快节奏的环境中高效推进项目进展。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-24T16:01:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"e4823009-4e98-48a8-ad7e-803402b65718","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390817399,"PostDateInt":1772785608000,"PostDate":"2026-03-06T16:26:48","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件测试-济南(J18142)","OrgId":885453,"Org":"智慧计算产品线","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·济南市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、负责服务器单板原理图设计审查以及器件容差审查，完成投板前的链路检视，并排查问题；\n2、深入了解硬件链路设计跟整机架构设计原理，并从中发现潜在设计问题；\n3、跟进业界最新标准规范发展(PCIE、SATA&SAS、USB、多项电源VR规范等)，掌握通信原理协议，并能联系实际单板设计，找出整机链路问题所在；\n4、深入了解服务器生态链中各类型厂家部件在服务器上的兼容设计(DIMM/HDD/SSD/RAID/NIC)，了解各类部件设计原理，设计专项用例，挖掘潜在隐藏问题，同步拉通各厂家进行问题根因定位；","Require":"1、电子、通信、自控、物理等相关物理类理工科专业统招本科及以上学历；\n2、5年以上硬件测试或开发经验，兼具测试、开发经验优先，具备X86硬件测试/开发经验优先；\n3、熟悉硬件链路基本设计原理，至少精通二次电源、高速链路、逻辑模块、低速设计等某一领域设计原理，并能够发现潜在电路设计问题；\n4、具备硬件SI、PI、容差等测试经验，并且至少精通其中一方面行业标准的分析能力以及原理的应用能力；\n5、具备硬件系统测试、容差测试分析以及FMEA分析模型经验。\n6、具有良好的抗压能力以及沟通协作能力；","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-06T16:26:48","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"55edc714-0d2a-4c03-89ed-1fb3f28d0e1c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390812696,"PostDateInt":1770796114000,"PostDate":"2026-02-11T15:48:34","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"负载均衡架构师（专家）(J18378)","OrgId":1606584,"Org":"安全产品线","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市","安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"作为负载均衡产品线的核心技术负责人，主导集高性能流量调度、深度安全防护与智能应用交付于一体的企业级1、产品的架构设计、技术攻关与演进。目标是打造在金融、政府、运营商等关键行业中，能与国际领先产品竞争并实现替代的自主核心方案。\n2、重点行业场景化需求和解决方案：深度理解重点行业特性与合规要求（业务流量模型，合规性约束与关键性能指标）。定义并设计针对性解决方案，针对重点行业场景，主导设计端到端的技术解决方案架构。解决方案转化为可验证的测试方案、部署指南及性能基线的经验，并协助交付团队解决在客户实际环境（尤其是复杂异构环境）中落地时遇到的技术难题。 具备将多个同类客户需求抽象化、产品化的思维与实践，从而提升后续同类项目的交付效率与标准化程度。\n3、技术战略与竞争力构建：深度分析行业top厂商(F5、深信服、迪普等)竞品优劣，规划并落实我司产品的核心差异化竞争策略。协同市场与产品团队，将需求转化为技术路标，主导未来3-5年的技术方向与前沿布局。跟踪前沿技术，决策并领导构建产品的关键技术护城河。\n4、行业方案与产品定义：基于金融、政务、运营商等行业经验，将客户痛点转化为可落地的一体化技术方案。将成功方案沉淀为可复用的行业组件或特性包，反哺产品平台演进，提升细分市场竞争力。\n5、核心架构设计与技术攻关：负责产品的整体软件架构设计、核心模块划分与技术选型，在性能、稳定性与安全性方面设定并达成业界领先标准。深入Linux内核与协议栈，主导TCP协议栈优化、多核并发、DPDK/智能网卡硬件加速等关键技术攻关，以支撑百万级并发与T级吞吐的企业级需求。负责L4-L7全网络协议栈的高性能、高可靠实现与优化。同时主导全局负载均衡(GSLB)、链路优化、SSL加速、流量编排等高级应用交付特性的规划与开发，全面提升产品竞争力。","Require":"1、5年及以上负载均衡产品领域工作经验，对服务器负载、链路负载、全局负载、SSL卸载、AI网关等业务功能模块的核心技术、应用场景有深刻理解，对产品的主流技术发展趋势有深入见解，能够指导产品的技术发展方向。\n2、熟悉国内外主流厂商的产品架构、档位规格对比、市场竞争态势、产品优劣势分析，参与过大型集采测试（运营商集采、金融6+12大行集采），有产品竞争测试实战经验。\n3、精通C/C++，对Linux内核（内存、进程、网络协议栈）有深刻理解和开发经验。深度掌握TCP/IP、HTTP/HTTPS、DNS等协议，有协议栈优化经验。具备高性能与并发，多核编程、性能调优、硬件加速（如DPDK） 经验者优先。\n4、有金融、运营商、政企等行业解决方案或产品开发经验者优先。\n5、至少主导或深度参与过一个完整的企业级网络/安全产品从概念设计、架构、开发、测试到大规模商用部署的全生命周期。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"技术类","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-11T15:48:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"830867fc-f79c-4f65-801e-3e30613be3d0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390810053,"PostDateInt":1769743072000,"PostDate":"2026-01-30T11:17:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件开发-济南(J18141)","OrgId":885453,"Org":"智慧计算产品线","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·济南市"],"Salary":"15K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、负责X86或ARM架构服务器单板硬件开发；\n2、\t负责单板方案设计、详细设计、原理图设计、逻辑代码设计，协助完成PCB设计等开发设计工作；\n3、\t负责关键器件选型、物料采购跟踪、单板BOM制作、原型机加工跟踪、整机试制跟踪